      "source_text": "import TGLExt.V351AveragePolarRight\n#check TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_polar_approximants\n#print axioms TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_polar_approximants\n#check TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_mem_scalarPolarRightAlgebra\n#print axioms TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_mem_scalarPolarRightAlgebra\n",
      "stream_text": "TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_polar_approximants (P : TGLExt.SiteProfile) (δ : ℝ) (hδ : 0 < δ) :\n  ∃ b,\n    (∀ (n : ℕ), b n ∈ TGLV350.Regular.scalarPolarRightAlgebra P) ∧\n      (∀ (n : ℕ), ‖↑(b n)‖ ≤ 1) ∧\n        (∀ (v : ↥(TGLV350.Regular.RegularHilbert (TGLExt.TowerHilbert P))),\n            Filter.Tendsto (fun n => ↑(b n) v) Filter.atTop (nhds ((TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage P δ) v))) ∧\n          ∀ (v : ↥(TGLV350.Regular.RegularHilbert (TGLExt.TowerHilbert P))),\n            Filter.Tendsto (fun n => ↑(star (b n)) v) Filter.atTop\n              (nhds ((star (TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage P δ)) v))\n'TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_polar_approximants' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nTGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_mem_scalarPolarRightAlgebra (P : TGLExt.SiteProfile) (δ : ℝ) (hδ : 0 < δ) :\n  ⟨TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage P δ, ⋯⟩ ∈ TGLV350.Regular.scalarPolarRightAlgebra P\n'TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_mem_scalarPolarRightAlgebra' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n"
